window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-063.json",{"day":63,"title":"When an Impressive Experiment Fails Again","targetWords":[{"word":"casual","gloss":"随意的","context":"Yet a casual conversation at a conference raised an uncomfortable question.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"intense","gloss":"强烈的","context":"The original team faced intense pressure to respond.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"intensive","gloss":"密集的","context":"During an intensive review, researchers found that the instructions were ambiguous about drying conditions.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"straight","gloss":"直接的","context":"Progress is not always a straight journey from brilliant idea to useful product.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"obscure","gloss":"不为人知","context":"One manager proposed keeping the revised findings obscure until contracts were signed.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"sudden","gloss":"突然的","context":"A steady process gradually revealed why a sudden change in humidity altered performance.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"alike","gloss":"与…相似","context":"The two laboratories seemed alike in their equipment and expertise.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"random","gloss":"随机的","context":"The team also discovered that several unsuccessful trials had been omitted because their failures seemed random.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"absent","gloss":"不在场的","context":"This inherent sensitivity was absent from the explanation supplied to readers.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"comprehensive","gloss":"广泛的","context":"A comprehensive investigation began with mutual access to raw records.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"subtle","gloss":"微妙的","context":"A subtle change in temperature had a visible effect on the final structure.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"crude","gloss":"粗鲁的","context":"A crude description that the material should remain warm was not equivalent to a precise temperature range.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"evident","gloss":"明显的","context":"Instead, it made the conditions for success evident and gave manufacturers a definite basis for planning.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"primitive","gloss":"原始的","context":"An outstanding discovery could still rest on primitive production methods, and acknowledging that limitation was necessary.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"steady","gloss":"持续的","context":"A steady process gradually revealed why a sudden change in humidity altered performance.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"equivalent","gloss":"相同的","context":"A crude description that the material should remain warm was not equivalent to a precise temperature range.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"ultimate","gloss":"终极","context":"The work was less exciting than the initial demonstration, but indispensable to its ultimate value.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"fake","gloss":"伪造","context":"Both groups had followed a reasonable interpretation of incomplete instructions, and neither needed to invent a fake result to produce the discrepancy.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"inferior","gloss":"下级","context":"Another team had followed the published procedure and obtained an inferior product.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"outstanding","gloss":"杰出的","context":"An outstanding discovery could still rest on primitive production methods, and acknowledging that limitation was necessary.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"prior","gloss":"先前的","context":"Prior assumptions about the correct method were tested rather than protected.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"rough","gloss":"粗糙的","context":"Its samples were rough, weak, and apparently unable to repair themselves.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"worthy","gloss":"值得的","context":"A worthy discovery becomes stronger when its makers explain failure clearly, because reliable knowledge grows through careful challenge as well as through moments of surprise.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"consistent","gloss":"一致的","context":"That decision made a consistent result appear more certain than the full record could justify.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"distinct","gloss":"不同的","context":"Understanding their distinct results would require more than defending a reputation or accusing a competitor of poor technique.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"apparent","gloss":"明显的","context":"The apparent contradiction between the laboratories now had a rational explanation.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"precise","gloss":"精确的","context":"A crude description that the material should remain warm was not equivalent to a precise temperature range.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"smooth","gloss":"光滑的","context":"The discovery looked extraordinary on a smooth demonstration film, and a thick report described its potential.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"collective","gloss":"集体的","context":"Its collective authors included researchers from both laboratories, reflecting a dynamic partnership rather than a contest for exclusive credit.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"concrete","gloss":"具体的","context":"The researchers created parallel experiments, used pure ingredients from the same supplier, and recorded every concrete step.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"dynamic","gloss":"动力","context":"Its collective authors included researchers from both laboratories, reflecting a dynamic partnership rather than a contest for exclusive credit.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"indispensable","gloss":"不可缺少的","context":"The work was less exciting than the initial demonstration, but indispensable to its ultimate value.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"parallel","gloss":"平行的","context":"The researchers created parallel experiments, used pure ingredients from the same supplier, and recorded every concrete step.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"visible","gloss":"可见的","context":"A subtle change in temperature had a visible effect on the final structure.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"ambiguous","gloss":"模棱两可的","context":"During an intensive review, researchers found that the instructions were ambiguous about drying conditions.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":{"en":"an ambiguous statement","zh":"含糊的说法"}},{"word":"prominent","gloss":"突出的","context":"A prominent research laboratory announced an incredible result: a new material could recover its original shape after serious damage.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"thick","gloss":"厚的","context":"The discovery looked extraordinary on a smooth demonstration film, and a thick report described its potential.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"mutual","gloss":"相互的","context":"A comprehensive investigation began with mutual access to raw records.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"pure","gloss":"纯粹的","context":"The researchers created parallel experiments, used pure ingredients from the same supplier, and recorded every concrete step.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"rational","gloss":"理性的","context":"The apparent contradiction between the laboratories now had a rational explanation.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"decent","gloss":"体面的","context":"The laboratory director rejected that approach as unworthy of a decent institution.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"definite","gloss":"明确的","context":"Instead, it made the conditions for success evident and gave manufacturers a definite basis for planning.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"incredible","gloss":"难以置信的","context":"A prominent research laboratory announced an incredible result: a new material could recover its original shape after serious damage.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"invisible","gloss":"看不见的","context":"Scientific credibility depended on making the invisible uncertainty in a polished presentation available for others to examine.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"steep","gloss":"陡峭的","context":"Investors had promised a tight schedule, and the cost of further testing represented a steep increase over the original budget.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"tight","gloss":"紧迫的","context":"Investors had promised a tight schedule, and the cost of further testing represented a steep increase over the original budget.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"extraordinary","gloss":"非凡的","context":"The discovery looked extraordinary on a smooth demonstration film, and a thick report described its potential.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"gross","gloss":"总的","context":"Gross sales projections had ignored even a slight risk that large batches would behave differently.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"slight","gloss":"轻微的","context":"Gross sales projections had ignored even a slight risk that large batches would behave differently.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"inherent","gloss":"固有的","context":"This inherent sensitivity was absent from the explanation supplied to readers.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A prominent research laboratory announced an incredible result: a new material could recover its original shape after serious damage. The discovery looked extraordinary on a smooth demonstration film, and a thick report described its potential. Yet a casual conversation at a conference raised an uncomfortable question. Another team had followed the published procedure and obtained an inferior product. Its samples were rough, weak, and apparently unable to repair themselves. The two laboratories seemed alike in their equipment and expertise. Understanding their distinct results would require more than defending a reputation or accusing a competitor of poor technique.","zh":"知名实验室宣布令人难以置信的发现：新材料遭严重破坏后可恢复原形。流畅演示视频看起来非凡，厚报告描述其潜力，但会议上的随意交谈带来不安问题：另一团队按已发表步骤制出较差材料，样品粗糙、脆弱，似乎不能自修。两实验室设备和经验相似。要理解不同结果，不能只维护名声或指责竞争者技术差。"},{"en":"The original team faced intense pressure to respond. During an intensive review, researchers found that the instructions were ambiguous about drying conditions. A subtle change in temperature had a visible effect on the final structure. This inherent sensitivity was absent from the explanation supplied to readers. A crude description that the material should remain warm was not equivalent to a precise temperature range. The team also discovered that several unsuccessful trials had been omitted because their failures seemed random. That decision made a consistent result appear more certain than the full record could justify.","zh":"原团队面临强烈回应压力。密集复查中，研究者发现干燥条件说明含糊：微小温差对最终结构产生可见影响，这种固有敏感性原文未提。笼统说材料应保持温暖，不等于给出精确温度范围。他们还发现几次失败试验因看似随机而被略去，使稳定性显得比完整记录能支持的更确定。"},{"en":"A comprehensive investigation began with mutual access to raw records. Prior assumptions about the correct method were tested rather than protected. The researchers created parallel experiments, used pure ingredients from the same supplier, and recorded every concrete step. The work was less exciting than the initial demonstration, but indispensable to its ultimate value. A steady process gradually revealed why a sudden change in humidity altered performance. The apparent contradiction between the laboratories now had a rational explanation. Both groups had followed a reasonable interpretation of incomplete instructions, and neither needed to invent a fake result to produce the discrepancy.","zh":"全面调查从互相开放原始记录开始。研究者检验而非维护先前假设，开展平行实验，使用同一供应商的纯原料并记录每个具体步骤。过程不如首场演示兴奋，却对最终价值不可缺少。持续研究逐渐揭示湿度突变如何改变表现，表面矛盾也有了理性解释：双方都合理理解了不完整指令，不需任何一方造假也会出现差异。"},{"en":"The financial consequences were serious. Investors had promised a tight schedule, and the cost of further testing represented a steep increase over the original budget. Gross sales projections had ignored even a slight risk that large batches would behave differently. One manager proposed keeping the revised findings obscure until contracts were signed. The laboratory director rejected that approach as unworthy of a decent institution. An outstanding discovery could still rest on primitive production methods, and acknowledging that limitation was necessary. Scientific credibility depended on making the invisible uncertainty in a polished presentation available for others to examine.","zh":"财务后果严重：投资者许诺紧迫进度，进一步测试大幅增加原预算。总销售预测甚至忽视大批次表现不同的轻微风险。有人建议合同签订前别披露修正发现，主任认为这不配称为体面的机构而拒绝。杰出发现仍可能依赖初级生产工艺，必须承认局限。科学信誉要求让他人审视漂亮展示背后看不见的不确定性。"},{"en":"The revised paper did not remove the material's promise. Instead, it made the conditions for success evident and gave manufacturers a definite basis for planning. Its collective authors included researchers from both laboratories, reflecting a dynamic partnership rather than a contest for exclusive credit. The lesson extended beyond one experiment. Progress is not always a straight journey from brilliant idea to useful product. It often requires returning to details that initially seem ordinary. A worthy discovery becomes stronger when its makers explain failure clearly, because reliable knowledge grows through careful challenge as well as through moments of surprise.","zh":"修订论文没有否定材料前景，而是说明成功条件，给厂商明确计划依据。共同作者来自双方，体现活跃合作而非争夺独占功劳。教训不止一次实验：进步并非总从精彩创想到有用产品直线前行，往往需要回到起初普通的细节。创造者清楚解释失败，会增强值得研究的发现，因为可靠知识既来自惊喜，也来自认真质疑。"}],"previous":62,"next":64});
